From: Duron27 <duron27@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 01:35:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Stage 2: remote players as AI-less NPCs with appearance,
 equipment, walking, cell visibility

- global.lua: profile/equip/state sync, per-cell visibility, cleanup of saved remote actors
- remote.lua (CUSTOM): disables AI and steers actor toward remote position for real animations
- relay: replay last profile/equip/state to late joiners; mirror echoes all three

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
